Value Filldown NETWORK (\S+)
Value Filldown PROTOCOL (\w+)
Value Filldown METRIC (\d+)
Value Filldown UPTIME (\S+(?:\s+\S+)?)
Value NEXT_HOP (\S+)
Value INTERFACE (\S+)

Start
  ^${NETWORK}\s+\*\[${PROTOCOL}/${METRIC}\]\s+${UPTIME} -> Continue
  ^\s+>\s+to\s+${NEXT_HOP}\s+via\s+${INTERFACE} -> Record
  ^${NETWORK}\s+\*\[${PROTOCOL}/${METRIC}\] -> Record
  ^.* -> Next
